    <p class="section-intro">Based on Glassdoor, Blind, and Indeed reports from candidates who've recently been through the Talabat funnel. The Spark Hire video sits at — or just before — Stage 1.</p>

    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">01</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>Spark Hire — One-Way Video</h4>
          <p>5–10 pre-recorded questions, asynchronous. Acts as a phone-screen replacement. Fit, motivation, English fluency, and on-camera presence are all being assessed in parallel.</p>
          <div class="stage-meta">Async · 20–35 min · You record alone</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">02</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>HR / Recruiter Screen</h4>
          <p>Compensation, notice period, motivation, basic English check, why Talabat over alternatives. Sometimes folded into the Spark Hire round.</p>
          <div class="stage-meta">Live · 30 min · Talent acquisition</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">03</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>Hiring Manager — Behavioral &amp; Deep Dive</h4>
          <p>The Marketing Partnerships Manager or Head of Marketing. Walks through past partnership work in depth. Probes for ownership, negotiation style, conflict, ambiguity.</p>
          <div class="stage-meta">Live · 45–60 min · Direct manager</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">04</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>Take-Home Case Study</h4>
          <p>~3 days. Almost always involves Excel data analysis and a presentation deck. Topic is usually: build a partnership proposal, evaluate a deal's ROI, or design a co-marketing campaign for a real partner category.</p>
          <div class="stage-meta">Async · 3 days · Excel + PPT</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">05</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>Case Defence + Peer Round</h4>
          <p>Present the case to the hiring manager plus a peer or cross-functional partner. Expect pushback, "what would you do if…" teasers, and mini-cases on the spot.</p>
          <div class="stage-meta">Live · 60 min · Manager + peer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-num">06</div>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h4>Final — Head of Department</h4>
          <p>Usually short (~30 min). Mostly cultural fit, two-way conversation, vision alignment. The decision is largely made before this round; it's a sanity check.</p>
